OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged over #10m village
OL,4,Aketamine haul
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been charged after
OL,7,Fpolice seized what is believed to be
OL,8,Fthe UK's second-largest haul of
OL,9,Fketamine.
OL,11,FWest Yorkshire Police said 500kg
OL,12,F(1,102lb) of the drug, worth an
OL,13,Festimated #10m, was found at a property
OL,14,Fon Rose Avenue in the the Upton area of
OL,15,FPontefract. The largest find was worth
OL,16,Fan estimated #17m and was found in
OL,17,FMerseyside in 2025.
OL,19,FThe force said 20 black bin bags were
OL,20,Ffound during the West Yorkshire
OL,21,Foperation, led by the Regional
OL,22,FOrganised Crime Unit.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
